          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Event angular density <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(d\\sigma/d\\Omega||)</marimo-tex></strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/2\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>3\u00b7cos_theta\u00b2\u00b7alpha\u00b2+alpha\u00b2+6\u00b7beta\u00b2\u00b7cos_theta\u00b2\u00b7alpha\u00b2+2\u00b7beta\u00b2\u00b7alpha\u00b2\n    -3\u00b7beta\u2074\u00b7cos_theta\u00b2\u00b7alpha\u00b2+beta\u2074\u00b7cos_theta\u2074\u00b7alpha\u00b2+6\u00b7beta\u2074\u00b7alpha\u00b2\n<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>s\u00b7beta\u2074\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+cos_theta<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b2\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1+cos_theta<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Massless limit, in units of <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\alpha^2/s||)</marimo-tex></strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/2\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>3+cos_theta\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b2/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>1-cos_theta\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b2</div></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
